<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A1" title="" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A </span>Summary of Notations</span></a></li>
