<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E188.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\chi}=\frac{1}{M_{0}}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(\mathcal{M}^{-1})]=\frac{1}{\kappa\hat{q}}g_{S}(z)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\chi}=\frac{1}{M_{0}}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(\mathcal{M}^{-1})]=\frac{1}{\kappa\hat{q}}g_{S}(z).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(188)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS6.SSS1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS6.SSS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Here, we used Lemma <a href="#A4.Thmtheorem4" title="Lemma D.4. ‣ D.4 Trace Identity for Projected Matrices ‣ Appendix D Preliminary Lemmas in Random Matrix Theory" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.4</span></a> to simplify Eq. (<a href="#A5.E191" title="In E.6.1 Order Parameters ‣ E.6 Simplified Expressions for the Saddle-Point Equations (derivation of the Result. ) ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">191</span></a>) to Eq. (<a href="#A5.E192" title="In E.6.1 Order Parameters ‣ E.6 Simplified Expressions for the Saddle-Point Equations (derivation of the Result. ) ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">192</span></a>).
We further introduce the order parameters <math id="A5.SS6.SSS1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS6.SSS1.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, which characterize the correlation between the weight matrix and the structure <math id="A5.SS6.SSS1.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> in the context of the IDG error, as follows:</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS6.SSS1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A5.EGx51" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E189"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E189.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle q_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E189.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(AA^{\top}{W^{*}}^{\top}W^{*})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>W</mi><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(AA^{\top}{W^{*}}^{\top}W^{*})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(189)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E190"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E190.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(\hat{\chi}AA^{\top}\mathcal{M}^{-1}T^{\top}T\mathcal{M}^{-1}+\hat{\bar{\chi}}AA^{\top}\mathcal{M}^{-1}R^{\top}R\mathcal{M}^{-1}+\hat{m}^{2}AA^{\top}\mathcal{M}^{-1}S^{2}\mathcal{M}^{-1})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(\hat{\chi}AA^{\top}\mathcal{M}^{-1}T^{\top}T\mathcal{M}^{-1}+\hat{\bar{\chi}}AA^{\top}\mathcal{M}^{-1}R^{\top}R\mathcal{M}^{-1}+\hat{m}^{2}AA^{\top}\mathcal{M}^{-1}S^{2}\mathcal{M}^{-1})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(190)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E191"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E191.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{r\kappa}\ab[\hat{\chi}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(S\mathcal{M}^{-2})]+\hat{\bar{\chi}}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(A^{\top}A\mathcal{M}^{-2})]+\hat{m}^{2}\kappa\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(S^{2}\mathcal{M}^{-2})]]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{r\kappa}\ab[\hat{\chi}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(S\mathcal{M}^{-2})]+\hat{\bar{\chi}}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(A^{\top}A\mathcal{M}^{-2})]+\hat{m}^{2}\kappa\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(S^{2}\mathcal{M}^{-2})]]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(191)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E192"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E192.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{\rho\kappa\hat{q}^{2}}\ab[\hat{\chi}\ab(g_{S}(z)+zg^{\prime}_{S}(z))+\rho\hat{\bar{\chi}}g^{\prime}_{\tilde{S}}(z)+\kappa\hat{m}^{2}\ab(1+2zg_{S}(z)+z^{2}g^{\prime}_{S}(z))]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>S</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{\rho\kappa\hat{q}^{2}}\ab[\hat{\chi}\ab(g_{S}(z)+zg^{\prime}_{S}(z))+\rho\hat{\bar{\chi}}g^{\prime}_{\tilde{S}}(z)+\kappa\hat{m}^{2}\ab(1+2zg_{S}(z)+z^{2}g^{\prime}_{S}(z))]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(192)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A5.E193" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E193.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{0}=\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(A^{\top}{W^{*}}A)]=\frac{\hat{m}}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(S\mathcal{M}^{-1})]=\frac{\hat{m}}{\rho\hat{q}}\ab(1+zg_{S}(z))" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{0}=\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(A^{\top}{W^{*}}A)]=\frac{\hat{m}}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(S\mathcal{M}^{-1})]=\frac{\hat{m}}{\rho\hat{q}}\ab(1+zg_{S}(z))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(193)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS6.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">E.6.2 </span>Conjugate Parameters</h4>

<div id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The saddle point equations which define the conjugate parameters are followed by <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G_{I}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G_{I}</annotation></semantics></math> (Eq. (<a href="#A5.SS3" title="E.3 Analysis of the Data-Averaged Replicated Partition Function ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.3</span></a>)) and <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G_{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G_{S}</annotation></semantics></math> (Eq. (<a href="#A5.SS3" title="E.3 Analysis of the Data-Averaged Replicated Partition Function ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.3</span></a>)) in Eq. (<a href="#A5.SS3" title="E.3 Analysis of the Data-Averaged Replicated Partition Function ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.3</span></a>).
In the RS ansatz, there is permutation symmetry among the replica indices.
As a result, the saddle point equations can be written for any <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a\neq b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a\neq b</annotation></semantics></math> as follows:</p>
<table id="A5.EGx52" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E194"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E194.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\chi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\chi}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E194.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\gamma\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,u^{a}u^{b}\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>D</mi><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mi>exp</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder></mstyle><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\gamma\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,u^{a}u^{b}\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(194)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E195"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E195.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\bar{\chi}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\bar{\chi}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E195.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\gamma\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,u^{a}u^{b}\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>D</mi><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mi>exp</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder></mstyle><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\gamma\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,u^{a}u^{b}\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(195)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E196"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E196.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{q}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E196.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\gamma\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(1+\beta u^{a}u^{b}-\beta\ab(u^{a})^{2})\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>D</mi><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>exp</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder></mstyle><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\gamma\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(1+\beta u^{a}u^{b}-\beta\ab(u^{a})^{2})\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(196)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E197"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E197.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\bar{q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\bar{q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E197.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\gamma\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(1+\beta u^{a}u^{b}-\beta\ab(u^{a})^{2})\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>D</mi><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>exp</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder></mstyle><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\gamma\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(1+\beta u^{a}u^{b}-\beta\ab(u^{a})^{2})\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(197)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E198"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E198.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{m}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E198.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\gamma\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(1-u^{a}\sum_{b=1}^{n}u^{b})\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>D</mi><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>exp</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder></mstyle><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\gamma\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(1-u^{a}\sum_{b=1}^{n}u^{b})\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{c}\ab(u^{c})^{2}],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(198)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{a}</annotation></semantics></math> is a Gaussian variable with covariance matrix <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}^{ab}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}^{ab}</annotation></semantics></math> (see Eq. (<a href="#A5.SS3" title="E.3 Analysis of the Data-Averaged Replicated Partition Function ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.3</span></a>)). Under the RS ansatz,
<math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{a}</annotation></semantics></math> can be represented using <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n+1</annotation></semantics></math> independent standard normal random variables <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{z}=\{z^{a}\}_{a=1,\cdots,n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{z}=\{z^{a}\}_{a=1,\cdots,n}</annotation></semantics></math> as:</p>
<table id="A5.EGx53" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E199"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E199.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle u^{a}=z^{a}\sqrt{\frac{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}+\chi}{\beta}}+z\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}+h_{\text{source}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi></mrow><mi>β</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle u^{a}=z^{a}\sqrt{\frac{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}+\chi}{\beta}}+z\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}+h_{\text{source}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(199)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where we introduced <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{\text{source}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{\text{source}}</annotation></semantics></math> as a source term used to generate moments of <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{a}</annotation></semantics></math>, which is evaluated at <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{\text{source}}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{\text{source}}=0</annotation></semantics></math>.
Here, by changing variables as <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{z}^{a}=\sqrt{z^{a}/\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{z}^{a}=\sqrt{z^{a}/\beta}</annotation></semantics></math> and taking the limit <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta\to\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta\to\infty</annotation></semantics></math>,
the integral of <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{z}^{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{z}^{a}</annotation></semantics></math> with Gaussian weight concentrates on <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{z}^{a}=\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{z}^{a}=\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> as:</p>
<table id="A5.EGx54" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E200"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E200.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\,\ab(\prod_{a}f\ab(u^{a}))\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{a}\ab(u^{a})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>D</mi><mi>𝐳</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mi>a</mi></munder></mstyle><mi>f</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>exp</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>a</mi></munder></mstyle><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\,\ab(\prod_{a}f\ab(u^{a}))\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{a}\ab(u^{a})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E200.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\,\ab(\prod_{a}f\ab(u^{a}))\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{a}\ab(u^{a})^{2}]}{\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\,\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{a}\ab(u^{a})^{2}]}\quad(n\to 0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>𝐳</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em">∏</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>exp</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>a</mi></msub><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>exp</mi><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>a</mi></msub><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\,\ab(\prod_{a}f\ab(u^{a}))\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{a}\ab(u^{a})^{2}]}{\int\mathrm{D}\mathbf{z}\,\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\sum_{a}\ab(u^{a})^{2}]}\quad(n\to 0)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(200)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E201"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E201.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\prod_{a}\int\mathop{}\!\mathrm{d}{\tilde{z}^{a}}\,f\ab(u^{a})\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\ab(\ab(u^{a})^{2}+\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{2})]}{\prod_{a}\int\mathop{}\!\mathrm{d}{\tilde{z}^{a}}\,\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\ab(\ab(u^{a})^{2}+\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{2})]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>a</mi></msub><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em">∫</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>a</mi></msub><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em">∫</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\prod_{a}\int\mathop{}\!\mathrm{d}{\tilde{z}^{a}}\,f\ab(u^{a})\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\ab(\ab(u^{a})^{2}+\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{2})]}{\prod_{a}\int\mathop{}\!\mathrm{d}{\tilde{z}^{a}}\,\exp\ab[-\frac{\beta}{2}\ab(\ab(u^{a})^{2}+\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{2})]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(201)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E202"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E202.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\left.\prod_{a}f(u^{a})\right|_{\tilde{z}^{a}=\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}}\quad(\beta\to\infty)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mi>a</mi></munder></mstyle><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left.\prod_{a}f(u^{a})\right|_{\tilde{z}^{a}=\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}}\quad(\beta\to\infty),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(202)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.4" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(u^{a})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(u^{a})</annotation></semantics></math> is a function of <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{a}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the value of <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> is the solution of the following optimization problem:</p>
<table id="A5.EGx55" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E203"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E203.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E203.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\argmin_{\tilde{z}^{a}}\ab[\frac{1}{2}(\tilde{z}^{a})^{2}+\frac{1}{2}\ab(u^{a})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0.167em">argmin</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup></msub><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\argmin_{\tilde{z}^{a}}\ab[\frac{1}{2}(\tilde{z}^{a})^{2}+\frac{1}{2}\ab(u^{a})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(203)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E204"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E204.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\argmin_{\tilde{z}^{a}}\ab[\frac{1}{2}(\tilde{z}^{a})^{2}+\frac{1}{2}\ab(\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}+\chi}\,\tilde{z}^{a}+\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}\,{z}+h_{\text{source}})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0.167em">argmin</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup></msub><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\argmin_{\tilde{z}^{a}}\ab[\frac{1}{2}(\tilde{z}^{a})^{2}+\frac{1}{2}\ab(\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}+\chi}\,\tilde{z}^{a}+\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}\,{z}+h_{\text{source}})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(204)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E205"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E205.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\frac{\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}+\chi}\ab(\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}\,{z}+h_{\text{source}})}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\frac{\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}+\chi}\ab(\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}\,{z}+h_{\text{source}})}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(205)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.5" class="ltx_p">We denote <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{a}</annotation></semantics></math> evaluated at <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{z}^{a}=(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{z}^{a}=(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{u}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{u}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e.,</p>
<table id="A5.EGx56" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E206"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E206.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\tilde{u}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\tilde{u}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E206.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}+\chi}+z\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}+h_{\text{source}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\ab(\tilde{z}^{a})^{*}\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}+\chi}+z\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}+h_{\text{source}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(206)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E207"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E207.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}\,z+h_{\text{source}}}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\hat{\bar{\chi}}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\sqrt{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}\,z+h_{\text{source}}}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\hat{\bar{\chi}}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(207)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.6" class="ltx_p">which does not depend on the replica index.
By substituting this property and taking the limit <math id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\to 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\to 0</annotation></semantics></math>, the saddle point equations Eqs. (<a href="#A5.E194" title="In E.6.2 Conjugate Parameters ‣ E.6 Simplified Expressions for the Saddle-Point Equations (derivation of the Result. ) ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">194</span></a>)–(<a href="#A5.E198" title="In E.6.2 Conjugate Parameters ‣ E.6 Simplified Expressions for the Saddle-Point Equations (derivation of the Result. ) ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">198</span></a>) can be rewritten as follows:</p>
<table id="A5.EGx57" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E208"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E208.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\chi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\chi}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E208.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left.\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(\tilde{u}^{*})^{2}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\gamma\frac{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}{\ab(1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi})^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left.\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(\tilde{u}^{*})^{2}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\gamma\frac{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}{\ab(1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(208)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E209"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E209.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\bar{\chi}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\bar{\chi}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E209.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left.\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(\tilde{u}^{*})^{2}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\gamma\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\frac{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}{\ab(1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi})^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left.\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\,\ab(\tilde{u}^{*})^{2}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\gamma\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\frac{\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{q}+q-2m+1+\sigma^{2}}{\ab(1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(209)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E210"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E210.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{q}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E210.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left.\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\frac{\mathrm{d}\tilde{u}^{*}}{\mathrm{d}h_{\text{source}}}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\gamma\frac{1}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left.\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\frac{\mathrm{d}\tilde{u}^{*}}{\mathrm{d}h_{\text{source}}}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\gamma\frac{1}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(210)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E211"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E211.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\bar{q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\bar{q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E211.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left.\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\frac{\mathrm{d}\tilde{u}^{*}}{\mathrm{d}h_{\text{source}}}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\gamma\frac{1}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left.\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\frac{\mathrm{d}\tilde{u}^{*}}{\mathrm{d}h_{\text{source}}}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\gamma\frac{1}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(211)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E212"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E212.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{m}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E212.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left.\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\frac{\mathrm{d}\tilde{u}^{*}}{\mathrm{d}h_{\text{source}}}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\gamma\frac{1}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>χ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>α</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left.\gamma\int\mathrm{D}z\frac{\mathrm{d}\tilde{u}^{*}}{\mathrm{d}h_{\text{source}}}\right|_{h_{\text{source}}=0}=\gamma\frac{1}{1+\chi+\frac{1}{\alpha}\ab(1+\sigma^{2})\bar{\chi}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(212)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS6.SSS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">These results in Section <a href="#A5.SS6.SSS1" title="E.6.1 Order Parameters ‣ E.6 Simplified Expressions for the Saddle-Point Equations (derivation of the Result. ) ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.6.1</span></a> and Section <a href="#A5.SS6.SSS2" title="E.6.2 Conjugate Parameters ‣ E.6 Simplified Expressions for the Saddle-Point Equations (derivation of the Result. ) ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.6.2</span></a> are summarized in Result <a href="#A5.Thmtheorem2" title="Result E.2. ‣ E.1 Results with Complete Statements ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS7" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.7 </span>Generalization Error (derivation of the Result <a href="#A5.Thmtheorem3" title="Result E.3. ‣ E.1 Results with Complete Statements ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.3</span></a>)</h3>

<div id="A5.SS7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this subsection, we compute the MSE in each protocol from Result. <a href="#A5.Thmtheorem1" title="Result E.1. ‣ E.1 Results with Complete Statements ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.1</span></a> using the order parameters defined by Result. <a href="#A5.Thmtheorem2" title="Result E.2. ‣ E.1 Results with Complete Statements ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.2</span></a>.
For the generalization error, we need to compute the correlation between the prediction using the optimal weight matrix <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> and the ground-truth label <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A5.SS7.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">E.7.1 </span>Task Memorization</h4>

<div id="A5.SS7.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS7.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The effective future matrix of the prompt in the task memorization setting is given by:</p>
<table id="A5.E213" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E213.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H=\frac{1}{M_{0}}\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\sum_{\mu=1}^{M_{0}}\ab[\mathbf{x}_{L+1}{\mathbf{w}^{\mu}}^{\top}\sum_{l=1}^{\tilde{L}}\mathbf{x}_{l}\mathbf{x}_{l}^{\top}]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></munderover><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>𝐰</mi><mrow></mrow><mi>μ</mi><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H=\frac{1}{M_{0}}\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\sum_{\mu=1}^{M_{0}}\ab[\mathbf{x}_{L+1}{\mathbf{w}^{\mu}}^{\top}\sum_{l=1}^{\tilde{L}}\mathbf{x}_{l}\mathbf{x}_{l}^{\top}],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(213)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS7.SSS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.SS7.SSS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{w}^{*}=1/M_{0}\sum_{\mu=1}^{M_{0}}\mathbf{w}^{\mu}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐰</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>M</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msup><mi>𝐰</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>μ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{w}^{*}=1/M_{0}\sum_{\mu=1}^{M_{0}}\mathbf{w}^{\mu}</annotation></semantics></math> is the averaged learned task in the pre-training.
We have the following relation:</p>
<table id="A5.EGx58" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E214"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E214.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{E}_{\text{TM}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>TM</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{E}_{\text{TM}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E214.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\ab[y-\tr(W^* H^\top)]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\ab[y-\tr(W^* H^\top)]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(214)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E215"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E215.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2\sum_{ij}\mathbb{E}\ab[yH_{ij}W^{*}_{ij}]+\sum_{ijkl}\mathbb{E}\ab[H_{ij}H_{kl}W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{kl}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2\sum_{ij}\mathbb{E}\ab[yH_{ij}W^{*}_{ij}]+\sum_{ijkl}\mathbb{E}\ab[H_{ij}H_{kl}W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{kl}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(215)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E216"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E216.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2\frac{1}{D}\frac{1}{M_{0}}\sum_{\mu}\tr\ab({\mathbf{w}^{\mu}}^{\top}W^{*}\mathbf{w}^{\mu})+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}}\frac{1}{D}\tr\ab({W^{*}}^{\top}W^{*})+\frac{1}{D}\frac{1}{M_{0}}\sum_{\mu}\ab(W^{*}\mathbf{w}^{\mu})^{\top}\ab(W^{*}\mathbf{w}^{\mu})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>μ</mi></munder></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>𝐰</mi><mrow></mrow><mi>μ</mi><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>μ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>W</mi><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>μ</mi></munder></mstyle><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>μ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>μ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2\frac{1}{D}\frac{1}{M_{0}}\sum_{\mu}\tr\ab({\mathbf{w}^{\mu}}^{\top}W^{*}\mathbf{w}^{\mu})+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}}\frac{1}{D}\tr\ab({W^{*}}^{\top}W^{*})+\frac{1}{D}\frac{1}{M_{0}}\sum_{\mu}\ab(W^{*}\mathbf{w}^{\mu})^{\top}\ab(W^{*}\mathbf{w}^{\mu})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(216)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E217"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E217.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2m+q+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}}\bar{q}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2m+q+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}}\bar{q}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(217)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS7.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">E.7.2 </span>In-Distribution Generalization</h4>

<div id="A5.SS7.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS7.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The effective future matrix of the prompt in the in-distribution setting is given by:</p>
<table id="A5.E218" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E218.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H=\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\ab[\mathbf{x}_{L+1}\ab(A\mathbf{v}^{*})^{\top}\sum_{l=1}^{\tilde{L}}\mathbf{x}_{l}\mathbf{x}_{l}^{\top}]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H=\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\ab[\mathbf{x}_{L+1}\ab(A\mathbf{v}^{*})^{\top}\sum_{l=1}^{\tilde{L}}\mathbf{x}_{l}\mathbf{x}_{l}^{\top}],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(218)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS7.SSS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.SS7.SSS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{v}^{*}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I_{r})\in\mathbb{R}^{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}^{*}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I_{r})\in\mathbb{R}^{r}</annotation></semantics></math>.
We have the following relation:</p>
<table id="A5.EGx59" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E219"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E219.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{E}_{\text{IDG}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>IDG</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{E}_{\text{IDG}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E219.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\ab[y-\tr(W^* H^\top)]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\ab[y-\tr(W^* H^\top)]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(219)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E220"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E220.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2\sum_{ij}\mathbb{E}\ab[yH_{ij}]\mathbb{E}\ab[W^{*}_{ij}]+\sum_{ijkl}\mathbb{E}\ab[H_{ij}H_{kl}W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{kl}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2\sum_{ij}\mathbb{E}\ab[yH_{ij}]\mathbb{E}\ab[W^{*}_{ij}]+\sum_{ijkl}\mathbb{E}\ab[H_{ij}H_{kl}W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{kl}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(220)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E221"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E221.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-\frac{2}{r}\sum_{ijkl}\mathbb{E}\ab[A_{ik}A_{jl}W^{*}_{ij}]\mathbb{E}\ab[v_{k}v_{l}]+\frac{1}{D}\sum_{ijl}\mathbb{E}\ab[\ab(\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\delta_{ij}+\sum_{st}A_{js}A_{lt}v_{s}v_{t})W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{il}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-\frac{2}{r}\sum_{ijkl}\mathbb{E}\ab[A_{ik}A_{jl}W^{*}_{ij}]\mathbb{E}\ab[v_{k}v_{l}]+\frac{1}{D}\sum_{ijl}\mathbb{E}\ab[\ab(\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\delta_{ij}+\sum_{st}A_{js}A_{lt}v_{s}v_{t})W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{il}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(221)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E222"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E222.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(A^{\top}W^{*}A)]+\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(\ab(W^{*}A)^{\top}W^{*}A)]+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}}\frac{1}{D}\tr\ab({W^{*}}^{\top}W^{*})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>W</mi><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(A^{\top}W^{*}A)]+\frac{1}{r}\mathbb{E}\ab[\tr\ab(\ab(W^{*}A)^{\top}W^{*}A)]+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}}\frac{1}{D}\tr\ab({W^{*}}^{\top}W^{*})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(222)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E223"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E223.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2{m}_{0}+q_{0}+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}}\bar{q}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2{m}_{0}+q_{0}+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}}\bar{q}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(223)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS7.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">E.7.3 </span>Out-of-Distribution Generalization</h4>

<div id="A5.SS7.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS7.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The effective future matrix of the prompt in the out-of-distribution setting is given by:</p>
<table id="A5.E224" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E224.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H=\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\ab[\mathbf{x}_{L+1}{\mathbf{w}^{*}}^{\top}\sum_{l=1}^{\tilde{L}}\mathbf{x}_{l}\mathbf{x}_{l}^{\top}]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>𝐰</mi><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H=\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\ab[\mathbf{x}_{L+1}{\mathbf{w}^{*}}^{\top}\sum_{l=1}^{\tilde{L}}\mathbf{x}_{l}\mathbf{x}_{l}^{\top}],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(224)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS7.SSS3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.SS7.SSS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{w}^{*}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I_{D})\in\mathbb{R}^{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>D</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{w}^{*}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I_{D})\in\mathbb{R}^{D}</annotation></semantics></math>.
We have the following relation:</p>
<table id="A5.EGx60" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.E225"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E225.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{E}_{\text{ODG}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>ODG</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{E}_{\text{ODG}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E225.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\ab[y-\tr(W^* H^\top)]^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\ab[y-\tr(W^* H^\top)]^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(225)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E226"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E226.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2\sum_{ij}\mathbb{E}\ab[yH_{ij}]\mathbb{E}\ab[W^{*}_{ij}]+\sum_{ijkl}\mathbb{E}\ab[H_{ij}H_{kl}]\ab[W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{kl}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2\sum_{ij}\mathbb{E}\ab[yH_{ij}]\mathbb{E}\ab[W^{*}_{ij}]+\sum_{ijkl}\mathbb{E}\ab[H_{ij}H_{kl}]\ab[W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{kl}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(226)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E227"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E227.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-\frac{2}{D}\sum_{ij}\mathbb{E}\ab[w_{i}w_{j}]\mathbb{E}\ab[W^{*}_{ij}]+\frac{1}{D}\sum_{ijl}\mathbb{E}\ab[\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\delta_{ij}+w_{j}w_{l}]\ab[W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{il}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-\frac{2}{D}\sum_{ij}\mathbb{E}\ab[w_{i}w_{j}]\mathbb{E}\ab[W^{*}_{ij}]+\frac{1}{D}\sum_{ijl}\mathbb{E}\ab[\frac{D}{\tilde{L}}\delta_{ij}+w_{j}w_{l}]\ab[W^{*}_{ij}W^{*}_{il}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(227)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E228"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E228.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2\frac{1}{D}\tr W^{*}+\ab(1+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}})\frac{1}{D}\tr\ab({W^{*}}^{\top}W^{*})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>W</mi><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2\frac{1}{D}\tr W^{*}+\ab(1+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}})\frac{1}{D}\tr\ab({W^{*}}^{\top}W^{*})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(228)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E229"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E229.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2\bar{m}+\ab(1+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}})\bar{q}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mtext class="undefined">\ab</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2\bar{m}+\ab(1+\frac{1}{\tilde{\alpha}})\bar{q}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(229)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS7.SSS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS7.SSS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">These results are summarized in Result <a href="#A5.Thmtheorem3" title="Result E.3. ‣ E.1 Results with Complete Statements ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.8 </span>Asymptotics under <math id="A5.SS8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\gg 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≫</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\gg 1</annotation></semantics></math> (derivation of Proposition <a href="#A5.Thmtheorem4" title="Proposition E.4. ‣ E.1 Results with Complete Statements ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.4</span></a>)</h3>

<div id="A5.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The proof proceeds by performing an asymptotic expansion of the saddle-point equations, presented in Result <a href="#A5.Thmtheorem2" title="Result E.2. ‣ E.1 Results with Complete Statements ‣ Appendix E Replica Calculation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E.2</span></a>, in the limit where <math id="A5.SS8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\to\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\to\infty</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS8.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS8.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The key insight is that in this limit, the system of equations simplifies considerably. First, we observe that the conjugate parameters <math id="A5.SS8.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\bar{q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\bar{q}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS8.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\bar{\chi}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>χ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\bar{\chi}}</annotation></semantics></math> vanish as <math id="A5.SS8.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{O}(1/\alpha)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{O}(1/\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math> or faster. This causes the parameter <math id="A5.SS8.p2.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="z=-(\lambda+\hat{\bar{q}})/\hat{q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z=-(\lambda+\hat{\bar{q}})/\hat{q}</annotation></semantics></math> to converge to a finite constant that is dependent of <math id="A5.SS8.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS8.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS8.p3.1" class="ltx_p">By substituting these simplified forms back into the equations for the primary order parameters (<math id="A5.SS8.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q,m,\bar{q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q,m,\bar{q}</annotation></semantics></math>, etc.) and retaining only the leading-order terms in <math id="A5.SS8.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>, the coupled system of equations becomes analytically solvable. This systematic expansion directly yields the explicit expressions for each parameter as stated in the proposition.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#S5.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 5.1 (Spectrum of the Task Matrix). ‣ 5.1 Spectral Analysis of Task Structure ‣ 5 Trade-offs from Task Difficulty" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.1</span></a></h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we proof Theorem <a href="#S5.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 5.1 (Spectrum of the Task Matrix). ‣ 5.1 Spectral Analysis of Task Structure ‣ 5 Trade-offs from Task Difficulty" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p2.1" class="ltx_p">From Lemma <a href="#A4.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma D.1. ‣ D.1 Resolvent Functions for Wishart-Type Matrices ‣ Appendix D Preliminary Lemmas in Random Matrix Theory" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.1</span></a>, the resolvent of <math id="A6.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> is given by:</p>
<table id="A6.E230" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.E230.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{S}(z)\;=\;-(1-\rho)\frac{1}{z}+\rho\frac{-(\kappa\rho z+\rho-\kappa)-\sqrt{\left(\kappa\rho z+\rho-\kappa\right)^{2}-4\rho^{2}\kappa z}}{2\rho z}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{S}(z)\;=\;-(1-\rho)\frac{1}{z}+\rho\frac{-(\kappa\rho z+\rho-\kappa)-\sqrt{\left(\kappa\rho z+\rho-\kappa\right)^{2}-4\rho^{2}\kappa z}}{2\rho z}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(230)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p2.2" class="ltx_p">By definition, the limiting spectral density <math id="A6.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nu_{S}(\lambda)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nu_{S}(\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math> is obtained from the imaginary part of the resolvent:</p>
<table id="A6.E231" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.E231.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\nu_{S}(\lambda)=-\frac{1}{\pi}\lim_{\epsilon\to 0^{+}}\text{Im}\,g_{S}(\lambda+i\epsilon)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>π</mi></mfrac><munder><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mtext>Im</mtext><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nu_{S}(\lambda)=-\frac{1}{\pi}\lim_{\epsilon\to 0^{+}}\text{Im}\,g_{S}(\lambda+i\epsilon).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(231)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A6.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A6.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\in[\lambda_{-},\lambda_{+}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\in[\lambda_{-},\lambda_{+}]</annotation></semantics></math>, the square root term in <math id="A6.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{\tilde{S}}(z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>S</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{\tilde{S}}(z)</annotation></semantics></math> contributes an imaginary part. A direct computation yields:</p>
<table id="A6.E232" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.E232.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{\epsilon\to 0^{+}}\text{Im}\,g_{\tilde{S}}(\lambda+i\epsilon)\;=\;\frac{1}{2\rho\lambda}\sqrt{4\rho^{2}\kappa\lambda-\left(\kappa\rho\lambda+\rho-\kappa\right)^{2}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">lim</mo><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mtext>Im</mtext><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mover accent="true"><mi>S</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{\epsilon\to 0^{+}}\text{Im}\,g_{\tilde{S}}(\lambda+i\epsilon)\;=\;\frac{1}{2\rho\lambda}\sqrt{4\rho^{2}\kappa\lambda-\left(\kappa\rho\lambda+\rho-\kappa\right)^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(232)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p3.2" class="ltx_p">Substituting this into <math id="A6.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{S}(z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{S}(z)</annotation></semantics></math> gives:</p>
<table id="A6.E233" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.E233.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nu_{S}(\lambda)\;=\;\frac{\rho\kappa}{2\pi\lambda}\sqrt{(\lambda_{+}-\lambda)(\lambda-\lambda_{-})},\quad\lambda\in[\lambda_{-},\lambda_{+}]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nu_{S}(\lambda)\;=\;\frac{\rho\kappa}{2\pi\lambda}\sqrt{(\lambda_{+}-\lambda)(\lambda-\lambda_{-})},\quad\lambda\in[\lambda_{-},\lambda_{+}],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(233)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p3.3" class="ltx_p">with the edges</p>
<table id="A6.Ex9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{\pm}=\frac{1}{\rho\kappa}\left(\sqrt{\rho}\pm\sqrt{\kappa}\right)^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>±</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>ρ</mi></msqrt><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mi>κ</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{\pm}=\frac{1}{\rho\kappa}\left(\sqrt{\rho}\pm\sqrt{\kappa}\right)^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A6.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Finally, since <math id="A6.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> has rank at most <math id="A6.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\min(r,M_{0})=D\min(\rho,\kappa)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min(r,M_{0})=D\min(\rho,\kappa)</annotation></semantics></math>, there is a mass <math id="A6.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\min(\rho,\kappa)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\min(\rho,\kappa)</annotation></semantics></math> at zero.
Hence, we have:</p>
<table id="A6.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A6.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nu_{S}(\lambda)\;=\;\left(1-\min(\rho,\kappa)\right)\delta(\lambda)\;+\;\mathbf{1}_{[\lambda_{-},\lambda_{+}]}(\lambda)\,\frac{\rho\kappa}{2\pi\lambda}\sqrt{(\lambda_{+}-\lambda)(\lambda-\lambda_{-})}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold"> 1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>π</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nu_{S}(\lambda)\;=\;\left(1-\min(\rho,\kappa)\right)\delta(\lambda)\;+\;\mathbf{1}_{[\lambda_{-},\lambda_{+}]}(\lambda)\,\frac{\rho\kappa}{2\pi\lambda}\sqrt{(\lambda_{+}-\lambda)(\lambda-\lambda_{-})}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Consistency of the Replica Method with Numerical Experiments</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we validate our analytical results from the replica method against numerical experiments. As depicted in Figure <a href="#A7.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ Appendix G Consistency of the Replica Method with Numerical Experiments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> and Figure <a href="#A7.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix G Consistency of the Replica Method with Numerical Experiments" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>,
the theoretical predictions for both the order parameters and the generalization error show excellent agreement with the simulation results, confirming the accuracy of our results.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F4" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.04548v1/check_orderparam.svg" id="A7.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:673/404;" width="673" height="404"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Comparison of the order parameters <math id="A7.F4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q,m,\bar{Q},\bar{m},Q_{0},m_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>m</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q,m,\bar{Q},\bar{m},Q_{0},m_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> obtained from the replica method (lines) with those obtained from the numerical experiments (error bars).
Parameters for (A-D): <math id="A7.F4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda=0.1,\sigma=0.1,D=70" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda=0.1,\sigma=0.1,D=70</annotation></semantics></math>;
(A)<math id="A7.F4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma=1.5,\rho=0.4,\alpha=2.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma=1.5,\rho=0.4,\alpha=2.0</annotation></semantics></math>;
(B)<math id="A7.F4.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=1.0,\rho=0.4,\alpha=2.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=1.0,\rho=0.4,\alpha=2.0</annotation></semantics></math>;
(C)<math id="A7.F4.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=1.0,\gamma=1.5,\alpha=2.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=1.0,\gamma=1.5,\alpha=2.0</annotation></semantics></math>;
(D)<math id="A7.F4.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=1.0,\gamma=1.5,\rho=0.4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=1.0,\gamma=1.5,\rho=0.4</annotation></semantics></math>. Error bars represent the standard error of the mean over <math id="A7.F4.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>10</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10</annotation></semantics></math> trials per point.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F5" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.04548v1/check_generalization_error.svg" id="A7.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:673/202;" width="673" height="202"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Comparison of the generalization errors (<math id="A7.F5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\text{TM}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{IDG}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{ODG}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>TM</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>IDG</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>ODG</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\text{TM}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{IDG}},\mathcal{E}_{\text{ODG}}</annotation></semantics></math>) obtained from the replica method (lines) with those obtained from the numerical experiments (error bars).
Parameters for (A-D): <math id="A7.F5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=4.0,\gamma=0.5,\alpha=4.0,\lambda=0.1,\sigma=0.1,D=60" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4.0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4.0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=4.0,\gamma=0.5,\alpha=4.0,\lambda=0.1,\sigma=0.1,D=60</annotation></semantics></math>;
(A)<math id="A7.F5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho=0.9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho=0.9</annotation></semantics></math>;
(B)<math id="A7.F5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho=0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho=0.2</annotation></semantics></math>. Error bars represent the standard errors of the mean over <math id="A7.F5.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5</annotation></semantics></math> trials per point.</figcaption>
